  m_Name: Carta_GemeoDigitalDaCidade
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "G\xEAmeo Digital da Cidade"
  _titleEn: City Digital Twin
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Um g\xEAmeo digital \xE9 um modelo 3D da cidade alimentado por dados
    reais, usado para simular obras, tr\xE2nsito e enchentes antes de decidir."
  _summaryEn: A digital twin is a 3D model of the city fed with real data, used to
    simulate construction, traffic and floods before deciding.
  _realWorld: "O Virtual Singapore \xE9 um modelo 3D detalhado de todo o pa\xEDs,
    criado pelo governo de Singapura para planejamento e pesquisa."
  _realWorldEn: Virtual Singapore is a detailed 3D model of the whole country, created
    by Singapore's government for planning and research.
  _tradeOffs: "Manter o modelo atualizado custa caro, e simula\xE7\xF5es bonitas
    podem dar falsa confian\xE7a nas decis\xF5es."
  _tradeOffsEn: Keeping the model up to date is expensive, and slick simulations
    can give false confidence in decisions.
  _sources:
  - Label: Virtual Singapore (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Virtual_Singapore
